    {
      "id": "e001019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 352,
      "y": 497.6,
      "width": 278.736328125,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "两用：\n• 空心跳：leader 维持权威\n  (含 read_ctx 给 ReadIndex 用)，voter, learner,\n  remove角色均可接收\n• 带日志：matchIndex/nextIndex\n  推进 commitIndex，voter, learner可接收\n回包 ok=true→清 cq/刷 last_ack_time_\n• 窗口内并行发多个rpc，发送前推进nextindex，\n  超时重发基于原matchindex，不超时基于nextindex,\n  重试无上限。",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "两用：\n• 空心跳：leader 维持权威\n  (含 read_ctx 给 ReadIndex 用)，voter, learner,\n  remove角色均可接收\n• 带日志：matchIndex/nextIndex\n  推进 commitIndex，voter, learner可接收\n回包 ok=true→清 cq/刷 last_ack_time_\n• 窗口内并行发多个rpc，发送前推进nextindex，\n  超时重发基于原matchindex，不超时基于nextindex,\n  重试无上限。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
