      "type": "text",
      "x": 1052,
      "y": 137.6,
      "width": 164.267578125,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "• 取 ri = rf_->ReadIndex()\n• 循环等 last_cmd_index_ >= ri\n• 再读本地 kv_store_\n• 失败重试 / 换 leader",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 取 ri = rf_->ReadIndex()\n• 循环等 last_cmd_index_ >= ri\n• 再读本地 kv_store_\n• 失败重试 / 换 leader",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
